[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to file upload handling, specifically an Unrestricted File Upload vulnerability. This vulnerability arises when an application allows users to upload files without adequately validating the file type or content. In this case, the API accepts PDF files for conversion but does not implement strict checks to ensure that the uploaded files are indeed valid PDF documents. This lack of validation can lead to the execution of malicious files or scripts disguised as PDFs, potentially compromising the server or exposing sensitive data. Attackers could exploit this vulnerability by uploading harmful files that the application is not designed to handle securely.

